## Scope in this repository

CC BY 4.0 applies, to the extent original to PINN Review Atlas, to curated annotations, taxonomies, classifications, normalized concepts, relationships, Atlas-authored scientific descriptions, documentation, diagrams, original data products, derived summaries, validation outputs, and related non-software research content.

It does **not** relicense third-party publication text, abstracts, publisher material, externally sourced metadata or data to the extent protected, third-party logos or marks, external publications, or other material for which the Atlas contributors do not hold the necessary rights.

